        rhoT t.Ch t.sel (t.tup μ) (t.m2 + 1) P ((LinearEquiv.det g' : t.X.Eˣ) : t.X.E) =
      z * topF t.Ch t.sel (t.tup μ) (t.cst μ) (t.m2 + 1) P p (cosetOf A (t.m2 + 1) (Nat.le_of_succ_le hi) β p) p' Z) := by
